WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:10.910
Dad and Hada were at the airport to pick us up.

2
00:00:10.911 --> 00:00:15.770
It was wonderful to see them.

3
00:00:15.771 --> 00:00:19.049
Dad: Hana! Bada! Over here!

4
00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:20.738
Hana & Bada: Daddy!

5
00:00:20.739 --> 00:00:22.386
Dad: Welcome home!

6
00:00:22.387 --> 00:00:26.618
Mom: It's good to be home.

7
00:00:26.619 --> 00:00:28.595
Bada: We're home!

8
00:00:28.596 --> 00:00:32.227
Hana: Oh, how I missed you!

9
00:00:32.228 --> 00:00:35.535
Mom: Take your suitcases into your rooms, kids.

10
00:00:35.536 --> 00:00:37.925
Dad: I'll help you.

11
00:00:37.926 --> 00:00:40.830
Dad: What was your favorite part of the trip?

12
00:00:40.831 --> 00:00:43.309
Bada: Going to Disneyland!

13
00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:46.277
Hana: I liked the cable car ride.

14
00:00:46.278 --> 00:00:50.385
Mom: For me, it was the wedding.

15
00:00:50.386 --> 00:00:52.633
Dad: Did you like San Francisco?

16
00:00:52.634 --> 00:00:55.973
Bada: Yes! I want to go back!

17
00:00:55.974 --> 00:00:59.056
Hana: But we missed you and Hada!

18
00:00:59.057 --> 00:01:04.389
Dad: Next time we can all go together.

19
00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:06.927
Dad: Thank you, Hana. I love it!

20
00:01:06.928 --> 00:01:09.000
Mom: This is for Hada.

21
00:01:09.001 --> 00:01:12.165
Hana: I loved going to San Francisco.

22
00:01:12.166 --> 00:01:16.660
But this is my home sweet home!

23
00:01:16.661 --> 00:01:19.370
Bada: I can't sleep, Hana.

24
00:01:19.371 --> 00:01:21.597
Hana: Me neither.

25
00:01:21.598 --> 00:01:24.213
Mom: We must all have jet lag.

26
00:01:24.214 --> 00:01:28.711
Hana: Jet lag? What's that?

27
00:01:28.712 --> 00:01:32.429
Mom: Right now it is afternoon in San Francisco.

28
00:01:32.430 --> 00:01:37.381
Mom: So our bodies still think we're in the U.S.

29
00:01:37.382 --> 00:01:40.678
Bada: Will we have jet lag forever?

30
00:01:40.679 --> 00:01:45.567
Mom: No. In a few days everything will be back to normal.

31
00:01:45.568 --> 00:01:51.034
Hana: I'm glad we're back home, Mom.

32
00:01:51.035 --> 00:01:55.922
I have many wonderful memories of San Francisco.

33
00:01:55.923 --> 00:01:58.773
Where can I go next time?

34
00:01:58.774 --> 00:02:03.238
Do you have any places you'd like to visit?
